Subject: [PATCH] fix(world): load and apply editable gamerules in Java options

Java 26.3 waits for a GAME_RULE_VALUES response before showing its in-world rules screen. Return the matching rules received from Bedrock and translate validated edits into Bedrock command requests. Omit rules whose behavior or value type differs between editions, and respect the Bedrock editable flag.
